I've made the final adjustments, targeting only `TeacherActionCards.tsx` and the navigation logic in `App.tsx`, as requested. I've updated the `actions` array to rename the first card to "Kirim Tugas Siswa," replacing "Buat Modul Ajar" and changing the icon to `fa-paper-plane`, with the ID as `'missions_shortcut'`. I created a wrapper in `App.tsx` around `setActiveTab` that also sets `activeSubTab` to `'missions'` when `'missions_shortcut'` is triggered. This meets the requirements without altering other tabs or simplifying forms. The card should now directly navigate to the missions sub-tab.


