I'm now focusing on ensuring that when a teacher clicks a specific card, I can trigger the desired sub-tab navigation. I will update the `TeacherActionCards` prop to accept a function that manages the sub-tab change. I will modify the interface in `TeacherActionCards.tsx` to handle more IDs. I also verified the usage of `setActiveTab` is correct, and am looking at the `TeacherActionCardsProps` interface.

